          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.152,
            0.898,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 仪器、用具: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 培养箱、高速离心机、荧光显微镜、荧光光度计或流式细胞仪、培养瓶、离心管。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.196,
            0.399,
            0.214
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:动物培养细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.216,
            0.899,
            0.259
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂: "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.1 \\sim 50 \\mu \\mathrm{g} / \\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 罗丹明 123 染液、培养基（参见“实验 33 人体外周血淋巴细胞培养与染色体标本制备”）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.268,
            0.291,
            0.292
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.303,
            0.67,
            0.322
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) 将培养细胞按 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\times 10^{6}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 个/ml 的浓度重悬于培养基中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.324,
            0.537,
            0.343
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 加入  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.1 \\sim 50 \\mu g/ml"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  罗丹明 123 染液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.346,
            0.718,
            0.365
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 在细胞培养箱中按 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "37^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\% \\mathrm{CO}_{2}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的条件孵育 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\sim 30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.367,
            0.727,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）用培养基重悬细胞，再离心收集，重复2次，以洗涤细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.389,
            0.722,
            0.408
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 重悬细胞于培养基中，37℃、5% CO₂ 的条件培养 60min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.41,
            0.901,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 按激发波长 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "488 \\sim 505 \\mathrm{~nm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 、发射波长 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "515 \\sim 575 \\mathrm{~nm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （一般为 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "530 \\mathrm{~nm}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "），用荧光显微镜、荧光光度计或流式细胞仪检测荧光信号。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.462,
            0.266,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
